{"meta":{"id":"tt0993846","type":"movie","name":"El Lobo de Wall Street","imdb_id":"tt0993846","description":"Película basada en hechos reales del corredor de bolsa neoyorquino Jordan Belfort (Leonardo DiCaprio). A mediados de los años 80, Belfort era un joven honrado que perseguía el sueño americano, pero pronto en la agencia de valores aprendió que lo más importante no era hacer ganar a sus clientes, sino ser ambicioso y ganar una buena comisión. Su enorme éxito y fortuna le valió el apodo de “El lobo de Wall Street”. Dinero, poder, mujeres, drogas. Las tentaciones abundaban y el temor a la ley era irrelevante. Jordan y su manada de lobos consideraban que la discreción era una cualidad anticuada; nunca se conformaban con lo que tenían.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0993846.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Nwnmyzrtd0FkcRyPqmdzTPppQa.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iJTObjSiH1D0DjAMLsafsoR18op.png","genres":["Crimen","Drama","Comedia"],"releaseInfo":"2013","released":"2013-12-25T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"180 min","imdbRating":"8.2","country":"United States of America","cast":["Leonardo DiCaprio","Jonah Hill","Margot Robbie","Matthew McConaughey","Kyle Chandler","Rob Reiner","Jon Bernthal","Jon Favreau","Jean Dujardin","Joanna Lumley","Cristin Milioti","Christine Ebersole","Shea Whigham","Katarina Čas","P.J. Byrne","Kenneth Choi","Brian Sacca","Henry Zebrowski","Ethan Suplee","Barry Rothbart","Jake Hoffman","Mackenzie Meehan","Bo Dietl","Jon Spinogatti","Aya Cash","Rizwan Manji","Stephanie Kurtzuba","J.C. MacKenzie","Ashlie Atkinson","Thomas Middleditch"],"director":["Martin Scorsese"],"writer":["Terence Winter","Jordan Belfort"],"trailers":[{"source":"PaAvUOXUohk","type":"Trailer","name":"El Lobo de Wallstreet Trailer Oficial Subtitulado (2014)","ytId":"PaAvUOXUohk","lang":"es"},{"source":"DO_96Ee_qWw","type":"Trailer","name":"EL LOBO DE WALL STREET -Tra